  Melato global polish compatibility shim.

  The Melato House system owns the global header, footer, body surfaces,
  CTA language and responsive presentation. The previous version of this
  snippet applied broad !important header/footer overrides and reintroduced
  rounded CTA pills after the House styles had loaded.

  The release-fixes stylesheet is intentionally loaded from this late shim so
  it runs after legacy theme CSS and merchant custom CSS. It only isolates
  House surfaces from those older selectors; it does not restore the retired
  global CTA mutation. Copyright remains owned by melato-footer.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
